    {
      "name": "PlaceOrder",
      "tag": 4,
      "heavy": true,
      "note": "v1 D6: residual_mode picks the unfilled-residual path — 0 P2PoolFallback (default), 1 Rest (rest the residual as a borrower bid; last_valid_unix_ts is its expiry, 0 = never), 2 Drop. Replaces the v0 OB_ONLY `flags` byte. ltv_buffer_bps (0..=10_000, last field) is an optional borrower LTV buffer: the collateral gate uses effective_cap = sub_vault.max_ltv_bps.saturating_sub(buffer); unfilled principal follows residual_mode. The same effective_cap is stamped on the loan as origination_ltv_bps and persists on a rested bid. 0 = prior behavior.",
      "accounts": [
