      "note": "Protocol-admin gated: appends a Pool SubVault. The program auto-assigns sub_vault_id from vault.next_sub_vault_id (1-based, monotonic, never reused; 0 is the sentinel/invalid id). max_ltv_bps / liquidation_ltv_bps are always explicit (1..=9_999, liq > max); the curator-fee split is per-sub-vault.",
